Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 05:32:52 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 01/20] seo(crawl): sitemap-index lastmod from build time, add
 compare/guide hubs to sitemap, drop SVG from image sitemap

Phase 14 batch B1 (audit 2026-09-01, Phase 2 T3/T4/T5):
- sitemap index and supplements carry a real lastmod (build time / newest page)
- 4 compare-category + 7 guide-cluster hubs enter the sitemap supplement
- image sitemap skips SVG entries (Google ignores SVG in image sitemaps)
- machine mirrors / site-index reuse BUILD_TIME_ISO instead of per-request now()
